# WildFly AI subsystem configuration reference.
#
# The ollama-chat-model, in-memory-embedding-model-all-minilm-l6-v2, and
# in-memory-embedding-store Galleon layers automatically configure the AI
# subsystem with sensible defaults. This script is NOT executed during build.
#
# Default resources created by the layers:
#   - ollama-chat-model named "ollama"
#   - in-memory-embedding-model named "all-minilm-l6-v2"
#   - in-memory-embedding-store named "in-memory"
#
# Environment variables for runtime configuration:
#   OLLAMA_CHAT_URL           - Ollama server URL (default: http://127.0.0.1:11434)
#   OLLAMA_CHAT_MODEL_NAME    - Model name (default: llama3.1:8b)
#   OLLAMA_CHAT_TEMPERATURE   - Temperature (default: 0.9)
#   OLLAMA_CHAT_LOG_REQUEST   - Log requests (default: true)
#   OLLAMA_CHAT_LOG_RESPONSE  - Log responses (default: true)
#   IN_MEMORY_EMBEDDING_FILE  - Embedding store persistence file (default: embeddings.json)
#
# Example: Override the model to use a different Ollama model:
#   /subsystem=ai/ollama-chat-model=ollama:write-attribute(name=model-name, value=mistral:latest)
